# v0.9.1 Phase 8 Task 32 — error envelope on parse failure.
#
# Spec §6.6: error envelope shape.
# A truncated parenthesis triggers URBI_ERR_COMPILE (mapped to
# "code":"parse" in the dispatcher's eval handler).

> {"id":2,"op":"eval","code":"1+("}
< "id":2 | "kind":"error" | "code":"parse"
< "id":2 | "kind":"done"
